	<!-- NADRA Biometric Verification -->
	<section class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
		<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">NADRA Biometric Verification for Your Visa Appointment</h2>
		<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Do it yourself with the PakID app</p>
		<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
			Before your German Embassy interview, you must submit a NADRA biometric verification
			document. There are two ways to get it &mdash; one costly and slow, the other quick and
			cheap.
		</p>

		<div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
			<div class="rounded-lg border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
				<p class="font-semibold text-amber-900">Option 1 &mdash; Embassy Shuttle Service (Costly &amp; Slow)</p>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-inside list-disc space-y-1.5">
					<li>Biometric is taken at the shuttle service on interview day</li>
					<li>Fee: Rs. 500</li>
					<li>Long queues &mdash; many students wait a long time</li>
					<li>Eats into your time on an already busy interview day</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-lg border border-indigo-100 bg-indigo-50 p-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
				<p class="font-semibold text-indigo-800">Option 2 &mdash; PakID App, Do It Yourself (Recommended)</p>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-inside list-disc space-y-1.5">
					<li>Fee: only Rs. 20</li>
					<li>Same-day document you can show at the embassy</li>
					<li>No queue &mdash; complete it yourself from home</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h3 class="mt-6 font-semibold text-slate-900">Step-by-Step: Get Your Document via PakID</h3>
		<ol class="mt-2 list-inside list-decimal space-y-1.5 text-sm text-slate-600">
			<li><strong>Download &amp; Login:</strong> install the PakID app and log in.</li>
			<li><strong>Start Biometric:</strong> select the "MBVS Biometric" option.</li>
			<li><strong>Verify Identity:</strong> take a selfie and scan your fingerprints when prompted.</li>
			<li><strong>Bank Selection:</strong> choose any bank &mdash; it doesn't matter which one.</li>
			<li><strong>Payment:</strong> scan the QR code and pay the Rs. 20 fee through the app.</li>
			<li><strong>Download &amp; Print:</strong> download the NADRA Biometric document, print it, and bring it on your appointment day.</li>
		</ol>

		<div class="mt-6 rounded-lg border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-4 text-sm text-amber-900">
			<strong>Important tip:</strong> always download the verification one day before your
			interview. It expires, so a document downloaded too early may not be valid on interview
			day.
		</div>
	</section>

