			<p><strong>What are your plans after graduation?</strong><br />I plan to [continue research/get a job in Germany/pursue a PhD].</p>
			<p><strong>Have you received acceptance letters from other universities?</strong><br />Yes/No &mdash; explain your reasoning for choosing this one.</p>
			<p><strong>What is the duration of your course?</strong><br />My [bachelor's/master's] course duration is [X] years.</p>
			<p><strong>When will your classes start?</strong><br />My classes will start on [date].</p>
			<p><strong>Why didn't you apply in the previous semester?</strong><br />My documents weren't complete / I had just graduated / the course was only available this semester.</p>
			<p><strong>Have you applied for a study visa before? Any past refusals?</strong><br />No, this is my first application, and I have no previous refusals.</p>
			<p><strong>Where do you see yourself in the next 5 years?</strong><br />Building my career in [field], ideally with a good company, growing my skills.</p>
			<p><strong>What is your expertise? How will it benefit your studies?</strong><br />I have experience in [field]; this course will deepen that expertise for my career growth.</p>
			<p><strong>How will this course benefit you? What will you do after your degree?</strong><br />I'll gain skills in [2&ndash;3 areas] that will help me secure a job in [field], possibly in Germany.</p>
